---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PartnerProof from '../components/PartnerProof.astro';
---
<Base title="Partner with us" description="Partner with No Fluff Cruising. Email portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com. Past work includes Hammies, Duvin, Blue Lagoon Park Nassau, Kuza Adventure Park Cozumel, Margaritaville at Sea, Norwegian Cruise Line, and Swoveralls." breadcrumbs={[{name:"Partner with us", url:"/partner/"}]}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <article>
      <span class="eyebrow">Brands and destinations</span>
      <h1>Partner with us</h1>
      <div class="answer"><b>The short answer</b>Email <a href="mailto:portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com">portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com</a>. That is the inbox for a brand, destination, or excursion partnership with No Fluff Cruising.</div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Who this page is for</h2>
        <p>You run a brand, a shore experience, or a destination that cruisers use. Matthew and Marlee film and write for people who are booked or about to book. If you want that audience to see your name, send the email above.</p>
        <p><a class="btn" href="mailto:portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com">Email portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <PartnerProof />
    <article>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>How a paid placement is labelled</h2>
        <p>Sponsored segments are labelled on the page and on the video. A partner does not write the verdict. Read the rule on our <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>. Questions about sourcing sit on <a href="/sources/">How we source</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
